IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg9-x-sale-of-assets`

-- Tests of dg9-x-sale-of-assets.l4 (8 Del. C. sections 271 and 272).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text, beside the assertion, before the run.
-- Dates are made with the core's YMD (year month day).

§ `s 271 Sale, lease or exchange of assets`

§§ `s 271(a) notice and vote`

-- "at a meeting duly called upon at least 20 days' notice": 20 calendar days.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the least notice of the meeting`)'s `how many units` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the least notice of the meeting`)'s unit EQUALS `calendar days`

-- Notice on 1 March, meeting on 21 March is exactly 20 days: allowed (inclusive reading, fork F1).
#ASSERT `s 271(a) the meeting is called upon at least 20 days' notice` WITH `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21
-- Meeting on 20 March is 19 days after: too short.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) the meeting is called upon at least 20 days' notice` WITH `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 20)
-- Meeting on 22 March is 21 days after: allowed.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) the meeting is called upon at least 20 days' notice` WITH `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 22

-- Stock corporation: a majority of the outstanding stock entitled to vote thereon.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a stock corporation`)'s `counted against` EQUALS `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a stock corporation`)'s proportion EQUALS 1 DIVIDED BY 2
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a stock corporation`)'s `must be exceeded`
-- Nonstock corporation (each of the three kinds): a majority of the members having the right to vote for the governing body and any others entitled to vote.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`)'s `counted against` EQUALS `another base named in the provision` "the members having the right to vote for the election of the members of the governing body and any other members entitled to vote thereon under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws"
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a charitable nonstock corporation`)'s `counted against` EQUALS `another base named in the provision` "the members having the right to vote for the election of the members of the governing body and any other members entitled to vote thereon under the certificate of incorporation or the bylaws"
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the vote that authorizes the sale, lease or exchange` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable`)'s `must be exceeded`

-- Everything in order: 51 of 100 votes, 20 days' notice, notice states the resolution: authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Exactly half (50 of 100) is not "a majority": not authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 50, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Notice only 19 days: not authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 20, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The notice did not state that the resolution would be considered: not authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The board never acted at a meeting: not authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS FALSE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The meeting was not duly called: not authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS FALSE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A nonstock corporation with 51 of 100 members voting for: authorized.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a nonstock corporation with membership interests`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 51, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not covered: more votes in favor (101) than votes entitled (100) cannot be a vote.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 101, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 100, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not covered: no votes entitled to be cast at all.
#ASSERT (`s 271(a) the sale, lease or exchange is authorized` WITH `the kind of corporation` IS `a stock corporation`, `the board of directors or governing body acted at a meeting and deems the terms and the consideration expedient and for the best interests of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the votes in favor of the resolution` IS 0, `the votes entitled to be cast on the resolution` IS 0, `the meeting was duly called` IS TRUE, `the date notice of the meeting was given` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 1, `the date of the meeting` IS YearMonthDay 2026 3 21, `the notice stated that such a resolution will be considered` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 271(b) abandonment`

-- After authorization or consent the board may abandon without further action by the stockholders or members.
#ASSERT (`s 271(b) the board or governing body may abandon the proposed sale, lease or exchange without further action by the stockholders or members` WITH `the stockholders or members have authorized or consented to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Without authorization the subsection says nothing: not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 271(b) the board or governing body may abandon the proposed sale, lease or exchange without further action by the stockholders or members` WITH `the stockholders or members have authorized or consented to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Subject to the rights, if any, of third parties under any contract relating thereto.
#ASSERT `s 271(b) the third party's contract rights survive the abandonment` WITH `a third party has rights under a contract relating to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(b) the third party's contract rights survive the abandonment` WITH `a third party has rights under a contract relating to the proposed sale, lease or exchange` IS FALSE)

§§ `s 271(c) subsidiaries`

-- The corporation's own assets (1000) plus those of two subsidiaries (200 and 300) are 1500.
#ASSERT (`s 271(c) the value of the property and assets of the corporation, counting its subsidiaries'` WITH `the value of the property and assets of the corporation itself` IS 1000, `the values of the property and assets of each subsidiary of the corporation` IS LIST 200, 300) EQUALS 1500
-- No subsidiary: only the corporation's own.
#ASSERT (`s 271(c) the value of the property and assets of the corporation, counting its subsidiaries'` WITH `the value of the property and assets of the corporation itself` IS 1000, `the values of the property and assets of each subsidiary of the corporation` IS EMPTY) EQUALS 1000
-- A subsidiary is wholly-owned AND controlled, directly or indirectly.
#ASSERT `s 271(c) the entity is a subsidiary of the corporation` WITH `the entity is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `the entity is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(c) the entity is a subsidiary of the corporation` WITH `the entity is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE, `the entity is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(c) the entity is a subsidiary of the corporation` WITH `the entity is wholly-owned by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS FALSE, `the entity is controlled by the corporation, directly or indirectly` IS TRUE)

-- A resolution is required for a sale of all or substantially all, to an outsider, with nothing in the certificate: yes.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS FALSE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in none of these`
-- To a subsidiary, with nothing in the certificate: no resolution required.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS TRUE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in none of these`)
-- To a subsidiary, but the certificate requires a resolution: required.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS TRUE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in the certificate of incorporation`
-- To a subsidiary, a requirement only in the bylaws does not displace the rule (the text names the certificate).
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS TRUE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in the bylaws`)
-- To an outsider with a certificate requirement as well: still required.
#ASSERT `s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS TRUE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS FALSE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in the certificate of incorporation`
-- Not all or substantially all of the assets: section 271(a) requires no resolution.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 271(a) and (c) a resolution of the stockholders or members is required for the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the sale, lease or exchange covers all or substantially all of the property and assets of the corporation, counting those of its subsidiaries` IS FALSE, `the transferee is a subsidiary of the corporation` IS FALSE, `where a provision requiring a resolution for a sale, lease or exchange to a subsidiary is made` IS `in none of these`)

§ `s 272 Mortgage or pledge of assets`

§§ `s 272(a) mortgage or pledge`

-- Stockholder consent to a mortgage or pledge is not necessary unless the certificate says otherwise.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(a) the authorization or consent of stockholders to the mortgage or pledge is necessary` WITH `where a provision requiring the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge is made` IS `in none of these`)
#ASSERT `s 272(a) the authorization or consent of stockholders to the mortgage or pledge is necessary` WITH `where a provision requiring the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge is made` IS `in the certificate of incorporation`
-- A bylaw or a board resolution does not make it necessary: the text names only the certificate.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(a) the authorization or consent of stockholders to the mortgage or pledge is necessary` WITH `where a provision requiring the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge is made` IS `in the bylaws`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(a) the authorization or consent of stockholders to the mortgage or pledge is necessary` WITH `where a provision requiring the authorization or consent of stockholders to a mortgage or pledge is made` IS `in a resolution of the board of directors`)

§§ `s 272(b) collateral sold or pledged`

-- (b)(2): value 100 against liabilities 100 is "less than or equal to": qualifies (boundary inside).
#ASSERT `s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE
-- Value 99 against 100: qualifies.
#ASSERT `s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 99, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE
-- Value 101 against 100: proviso (i) fails.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 101, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)
-- Prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge: proviso (ii) fails.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS TRUE)
-- Does not reduce or eliminate the secured liabilities.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS TRUE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS FALSE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)
-- The board did not authorize it.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b)(2) the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies` WITH `the board of directors authorizes an alternative sale, lease or exchange, whether with the secured party or with another person` IS FALSE, `the alternative sale, lease or exchange results in the reduction or elimination of the total liabilities or obligations secured by the property or assets` IS TRUE, `the value of the property or assets` IS 100, `the total amount of the liabilities or obligations being eliminated or reduced` IS 100, `the sale, lease or exchange is prohibited by the law governing the mortgage or pledge` IS FALSE)
-- The sentence on consideration is a definition carrier and states no fact.
#ASSERT `s 272(b)(2) the framing of consideration provided to the corporation or its stockholders`

-- (b): collateral, and either (1) the secured party's exercise of its rights or (2) the board's qualifying alternative.
#ASSERT `s 272(b) no resolution by stockholders is required by s 271(a) for the sale, lease or exchange of the collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies under s 272(b)(2)` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 272(b) no resolution by stockholders is required by s 271(a) for the sale, lease or exchange of the collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS FALSE, `the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies under s 272(b)(2)` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b) no resolution by stockholders is required by s 271(a) for the sale, lease or exchange of the collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS TRUE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS FALSE, `the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies under s 272(b)(2)` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(b) no resolution by stockholders is required by s 271(a) for the sale, lease or exchange of the collateral` WITH `the property or assets are collateral that secures a mortgage or are pledged to a secured party` IS FALSE, `the secured party exercises its rights under the law governing the mortgage or pledge to effect the sale, lease or exchange without the consent of the corporation` IS TRUE, `the board's alternative sale, lease or exchange qualifies under s 272(b)(2)` IS TRUE)

§§ `s 272(c) protection of the transferee`

-- Value given and good faith, and not a proceeding to enjoin before consummation: the failure does not invalidate.
#ASSERT `s 272(c) the failure to satisfy the proviso in s 272(b)(2)(i) does not invalidate the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS TRUE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS FALSE
-- A proceeding to enjoin before consummation: the preceding sentence does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(c) the failure to satisfy the proviso in s 272(b)(2)(i) does not invalidate the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS TRUE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS TRUE)
-- No value given.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(c) the failure to satisfy the proviso in s 272(b)(2)(i) does not invalidate the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS FALSE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS TRUE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS FALSE)
-- Not in good faith.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 272(c) the failure to satisfy the proviso in s 272(b)(2)(i) does not invalidate the sale, lease or exchange` WITH `the transferee provided value for the property or assets, which may include the reduction or elimination of the liabilities or obligations secured by them` IS TRUE, `the transferee acted in good faith as defined in § 1-201(b) of Title 6` IS FALSE, `the proceeding is one against the corporation and any other necessary parties to enjoin the sale, lease or exchange before its consummation` IS FALSE)
-- A claim for a violation of fiduciary duty by a current or former director, officer or stockholder keeps its liability; any other claim: not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 272(c) liability for monetary damages for the claim is not eliminated by the protection of the transferee` WITH `the claim is based upon a violation of fiduciary duty by a current or former director or officer or stockholder` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 272(c) liability for monetary damages for the claim is not eliminated by the protection of the transferee` WITH `the claim is based upon a violation of fiduciary duty by a current or former director or officer or stockholder` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 272(d) certificate provisions`

-- The date is 1 August 2023.
#ASSERT `s 272(d) the first day of the provisions to which subsection (d) applies` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2023 8 1
-- A provision first effective on 1 August 2023 that does not expressly so require does not apply to a transaction permitted by (b).
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) the certificate provision requiring stockholder authorization or consent applies to the transaction permitted by s 272(b)` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS YearMonthDay 2023 8 1, `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The same provision, expressly so requiring: it applies.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) the certificate provision requiring stockholder authorization or consent applies to the transaction permitted by s 272(b)` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS YearMonthDay 2023 8 1, `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- First effective on 31 July 2023 (one day before): subsection (d) does not reach it, so it says nothing: not covered.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) the certificate provision requiring stockholder authorization or consent applies to the transaction permitted by s 272(b)` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS YearMonthDay 2023 7 31, `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- First effective in 2026: subsection (d) applies.
#ASSERT (`s 272(d) the certificate provision requiring stockholder authorization or consent applies to the transaction permitted by s 272(b)` WITH `the date the certificate provision first became effective` IS YearMonthDay 2026 1 15, `the certificate provision expressly requires its application to a transaction permitted by s 272(b)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
